Earlier {{term|sdór|lang=ga}} and {{term|stór|lang=ga}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|ga}} {{term|instauro|instaurō|lang=la}}.  Cognate with English [[store]].

====Noun====
{{infl|ga|noun|g=m}}

